---
description: "SQLAlchemy models and Alembic migrations."
globs:
  - "app/models/**/*.py"
  - "alembic/**/*.py"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow root `AGENTS.md`.

When changing persistence:

- Use async SQLAlchemy 2.x; never block the event loop.
- Add or update Alembic migrations when models change.
- Review auto-generated migration diffs before applying.
- Keep connection and session setup in `app/core/`.
